{
 "description": "For format strings. Currency: USD \"$#,0.00\", EUR \"€ #,0.00\". Sales: A 500 USD, B 2000000 EUR, C 1500 USD; Sales[Currency] -> Currency[Code]. Measures, each SUM ( Sales[Amount] ) (total 2002000): [Sales Amount], dynamic format string IF ( SELECTEDMEASURE () <= 1E6, \"#0,.00\", \"#0,,.00 M\" ) (SQLBI's example); [Converted], dynamic SELECTEDVALUE ( Currency[Format], \"\\$#,0.00;(\\$#,0.00);\\$#,0.00\" ) (Learn's example); [Self Ref], dynamic IF ( [Self Ref] > 10000, \"#,0\", \"0.00\" ); [Static], format string \"#,0\".",
